      "writtenOn": "2025-10-14T18:04:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The behavior of `build` is changed so that it can only ever be called once, and in fact calling any other method later becomes undefined behavior. There should really be `SkASSERT(fDisplayParams)` in every method that uses it, and this should be renamed `detach`.",
